td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">48.8 &#x000b1;12.7</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">48.2 &#x000b1;13.1</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">RLP-cholesterol (mg/dL)</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">4.3 &#x000b1; 1.6</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">7.5 &#x000b1; 1.0 <xref ref-type="table-fn" rid="tfn4-ndt-3-177">&#x02020;</xref></td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Insulin resistance (HOMA-IR)&#x02013;fasting</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">1.19 &#x000b1; 0.6</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">1.23 &#x000b1; 0.7</td></tr></tbody></table><table-wrap-foot><fn id="tfn1-ndt-3-177"><p>All values are mean &#x000b1; SD.</p></fn><fn id="tfn2-ndt-3-177"><label>*</label><p>p &#x0003c; 0.05</p></fn><fn id="tfn3-ndt-3-177"><label>**</label><p>p &#x0003c; 0.01 compared with fasting values.</p></fn><fn id="tfn4-ndt-3-177"><label>&#x02020;</label><p>p &#x0003c; 0.05 compared with risperidone.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></floats-wrap></article>